['Mailchimp','Editorial brands with a few stable interests','Audience tags and campaign content','Advanced dynamic content needs more setup','https://mailchimp.com/features/email/','Mailchimp works when personalization can be explained with a handful of durable interest groups. Prefer declared choices over silently converting every click into a profile fact.'],
