['GetResponse','Personalization paired with landing pages or events','Automation, forms, and event tools','Broader suite adds operational overhead','https://www.getresponse.com/features','GetResponse is useful when signup source, event registration, or attendance changes follow-up. Keep event-specific attributes temporary and remove them when their purpose ends.'],
