<thead><tr><th>Failure</th><th>Prevention</th><th>Cost of getting it wrong</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Discount in the first touch</td><td>Personalization incentives only after intent signals</td><td>Personalization first-touch codes cheapen the brand</td></tr>
<tr><td>No purchase suppression</td><td>Exit the purchased cart on a matched order; recheck purpose, suppression, and case state for other follow-up</td><td>Post-order personalization pitches feel blind</td></tr>
