<h2 class="mt-12">Implementation order for a personalization program</h2>
<ol>
<li>Record personalization permission origins in the ESP before sending.</li>
<li>Prove personalization-critical Shopify events — order, cart, refund, support — fire in a test store.</li>
<li>Write personalization suppression and exits before any personalization flow exists.</li>
<li>Pilot one content decision among eligible recipients with randomized assignment, a predeclared outcome window, and uncertainty reporting. Keep required order and service notices in both arms; only optional marketing varies.</li>
<li>At the planned review, score margin and audience health; extend observation when repeat-purchase timing or sample size makes a thirty-day comparison inconclusive.</li>
<li>Broaden personalization after the pilot survives handoff.</li>
<li>Codify the personalization peak freeze: edits, discounts, volume.</li>
<li>Quarterly, compare matched all-in costs with contribution and estimated incremental outcomes; attributed margin alone cannot establish causal value.</li>
<li>For personalization, dusty journeys get archived quarterly.</li>
</ol>
